# API Server Conventions

## Layout

- Routes: `*.routes.ts` → controller → service
- Feature gates: `*.gate.ts`, `modules/operational/pilot.ts`
- Register in `src/routes/index.ts`

## Patterns

- ESM imports with `.js` extension in TS source
- Operational errors: class + `statusCode` (403 pilot, 503 disabled)
- SSH: `validateReadonlyCommand` before execute
- DB: `@workspace/db` Drizzle tables

## Env

Check `lib/env.ts` and module gates before enabling runtime collection.

## After changes

```bash
cd workspace/artifacts/api-server && npx tsc --noEmit
docker compose build api && docker compose up -d api
```
